{%- comment -%}
  Hero Vanta loader — three.js + VANTA.CLOUDS + hero-vanta.js.

  Scripts are deferred (non-blocking) so HTML/LCP stay free, but they must be
  present as real <script src> tags. Dynamically injecting ~600KB of three.js
  after IntersectionObserver proved unreliable (engine missing → cream fallback).
  Init itself remains lazy via IntersectionObserver inside hero-vanta.js.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'three.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'vanta.clouds.min.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'hero-vanta.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
